    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/8-woodstown-hill-woodstown-village-knocklyon-dublin-d16-eh28\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 8 Woodstown Hill, Knocklyon in Dublin.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 8 Woodstown Hill, a stunning semi-detached property located in the charming Woodstown Village of Knocklyon, Dublin, D16 EH28. This delightful two-bedroom home, with additional attic space, combines classic architectural design with modern living, offering a spacious and highly practical layout across multiple floors, as detailed in the floor plan.\r\n\r\nThe exterior of the house is characterised by its elegant brick façade, complemented by a neatly maintained front lawn and shrubs, enhancing the street appeal. A private driveway provides convenient off-street parking.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, the ground floor reveals an expansive living space that is both welcoming and functional. The living room is bathed in natural light from large windows and is perfect for relaxation or entertaining. The highlight of this floor is the impressive kitchen, which offers excellent space for cooking, dining, and everyday family living. From here, the layout flows into a bright sun room, creating an additional living area that is ideal for relaxing, entertaining, or enjoying views over the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nThe low-maintenance back garden further adds to the appeal, providing an outdoor space that can be easily enjoyed without significant upkeep. The ground floor also benefits from a bathroom, a laundry room, and further flexible rooms to the rear, providing excellent additional space for storage, hobbies, home working, or other practical uses. This gives the property a particularly versatile ground-floor layout, well suited to modern family life.\r\n\r\nThe first floor offers two generously sized bedrooms, both well-proportioned and designed with comfort in mind. One of the bedrooms benefits from an ensuite bathroom, while there is also a separate main bathroom on this level, adding to the overall convenience of the home. A standout feature of the first floor is the giant-sized walk-in wardrobe, along with a second walk-in wardrobe, offering excellent storage space.\r\n\r\nThe attic level provides a spacious attic room, extending to approximately 23 sq. m. This area offers excellent additional flexible space and benefits from its own WC facility, making it a very useful part of the home.\r\n\r\nLocated in a prime position, the property benefits from excellent local amenities. Knocklyon offers various schools, sports clubs, and shopping centres within a short distance. Commuters will appreciate the convenient transport links, with nearby bus stops and easy access to major road networks, ensuring quick connections to Dublin city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nThis property is ideal for families seeking a larger home in a vibrant community or investors looking to capitalise on the growing area. With its superb layout, generous internal space, low-maintenance outdoor area, and ideal location, 8 Woodstown Hill presents a unique opportunity for those in search of a practical and appealing residence."
      },
